\fs20\insrsid4402984 COBOL compilers are available for most computers. The same COBOL program may be compiled and run on a variety of different machines. 
\par The universality of COBOL allows computer uses greater flexibility than they would have with many other languages. A compa
ny is free to acquire different brands of computers while using a single programming language. Similarly, conversion from one model computer to a more advanced or newer one presents no great problem as long as there is a COBOL compiler for each model. 

