\par 
\par Alternatively the GO TO statement can be used to transfer control to one of the different procedure names.
\par 
\par E.g :\tab IF ACCOUNT-TYPE IS EQUAL TO 1 GO TO PARA1
\par \tab \tab ELSE IF ACCOUNT-TYPE IS EQUAL TO 2 GO TO PARA2
\par \tab \tab \tab ELSE IF ACCOUNT-TYPE IS EQUAL TO 3 GO TO PARA3
\par \tab \tab \tab \tab ELSE IF ACCOUNT-TYPE IS EQUAL TO 4 GO TO PARA4.
