\fs20\insrsid4402984 The + PICTURE character is used to print wither a plus sign or a minus sign for all values. A + sign will be generated for positive or unsigned quantities, and a \endash 
 sign will be generated for negative quantities. The sending field should have an $ in its PICTURE clause for it to be interpreted as a signed number. 
\par }\pard\plain \ltrpar\qj \li0\ri0\widctlpar\wrapdefault\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid16136647 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24\alang1025 \ltrch\fcs0 \fs24\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs20 \ltrch\fcs0 
