\par The + or \endash  PICTURE character can appear as the leftmost or rightmost character. They can also be floated, similar to the $ character. However , the +, -, and $ are mutually exclusive as floating characters. If we want to have both $ float and + or 
\endash  sign representation, we write the + or \endash  to the right of the field.
