\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs20 \ltrch\fcs0 \fs20\lang1033\langfe1033\langnp1033\langfenp1033\insrsid4402984 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 2.\tab}Work or sort file : File used to store records temporarily during the sorting process.

\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs20 \ltrch\fcs0 \fs20\lang1033\langfe1033\langnp1033\langfenp1033\insrsid4402984 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 3.\tab}Output file: File of sorted output records.
\par }\pard \ltrpar\qj \li0\ri0\widctlpar\wrapdefault\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid16136647 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs20 \ltrch\fcs0 \fs20\insrsid4402984 
