\fs20\insrsid4402984 The identifiers specified in the USING clause in the PROCEDURE DIVISION entry include all fields defined in the LINKAGE SECTION; these 
identifiers will be passed from one program to the other. They are passed to and from corresponding identifiers in the CALL \'85 USING of the main program.
\par The USING clause of the CALL statement is required if the subprogram performs any operations in which data is to be passed from one program to another. The CALL \'85
 USING identifies fields in the main or calling program that will be either passed to the called program before it is executed, or passed back to the calling program after the called program has been executed.
\par 
